@startuml SALUD_Module_39_reporting
title Module 39 — Reporting, Dashboards and Scheduled Distribution\n(schema: reporting)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
hide circle

' ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
' SOURCE CONSOLIDATED: diagram_39_reporting.puml
' ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
note as BIZ_diagram_39_reporting
  BUSINESS PURPOSE
  A configuration-driven reporting engine so the application supports dynamic reports
  without code changes. Report definitions declare a governed dataset, parameters,
  columns and output formats; versions are tracked; schedules and subscriptions drive
  automated execution and distribution; executions capture parameters, row counts and
  the produced file; dashboards compose reports into visual surfaces. Reads only from
  governed read models (module 30) — never grants authority.
end note

