note as DEP_diagram_39_reporting
  Connects to other modules via:
  directory.tenants, iam.users, common.files (output_file_id), authz.permissions,
  read_models.read_model_definitions (data_source), messaging.message_channels
  (distributions/subscriptions), terminology.value_sets/catalog_concepts.
end note

note as REC_REPORTING_diagram_39_reporting
  DYNAMIC + GOVERNED
  Reports resolve their dataset through read_models (module 30), which already apply
  permission, purpose, scope, RLS and field masking — reporting never bypasses these.
  data_type columns use the technical_data_type enum; parameters bind to value_sets.
end note


